efunds available.\"}, {\"title\": \"AMENDING YOUR BOOKING\", \"description\": \"Customers have the ability to change the date or time of travel, beyond the level of flexibility provided by the ticket, but this must be prior to expiry of the booked departure validity window. After this, the ticket has no value and a new one must be purchased. The new journey must include the same origin and destination stations, as well as the same route and operator conditions. Customers will need to present the ticket(s) and reservation(s) when they request a change. This is subject to the payment up to GBP 10.00 fee per ticket per person and any difference in fares. If you change to a train on which a cheaper fare is available, the difference will not be refunded.\"}, {\"title\": \"DISCOUNTS\", \"description\": \"Child and railcard discounts apply.\"}, {\"title\": \"CODE\", \"description\": \"DNU\"}, {\"title\": \"ACCESSIBILITY\", \"description\": \"View information about wheelchair spaces and accessibility on board your train here www.nationalrail.co.uk/on-the-train/accessible-train-travel-and-facilities. Find out how to book travel assistance here www.nationalrail.co.uk/help-and-assistance/passenger-assist.\"}], \"validityPeriods\": {\"outward\": \"P1D\"}, \"conditionsSummary\": \"Flexibility to travel on LNER services within 70 minutes of the booked departure time. No refunds.\", \"secondaryFare\": false, \"farePricingCategory\": \"default\"}, \"4eee47d9-7fab-40e0-aad0-f524c85797a1\": {\"id\": \"4eee47d9-7fab-40e0-aad0-f524c85797a1\", \"name\": \"Advance Single (1st Class)\", \"code\": \"urn:trainline:atoc:fare:OHS\", \"conditions\": [{\"title\": \"DESCRIPTION\", \"description\": \"Non-refundable ticket, only valid for the date, time and trains specified.\"}, {\"title\": \"VALIDITY\", \"description\": \"You must travel on the date, time and trains specified. You may not start, break and resume, or end your journey at any intermediate station except to change to/from connecting 