title\": \"AMENDING YOUR BOOKING\", \"description\": \"Customers have the ability to change the date or time of travel, beyond the level of flexibility provided by the ticket, but this must be prior to expiry of the booked departure validity window. After this, the ticket has no value and a new one must be purchased. The new journey must include the same origin and destination stations, as well as the same route and operator conditions. Customers will need to present the ticket(s) and reservation(s) when they request a change. This is subject to the payment up to GBP 10.00 fee per ticket per person and any difference in fares. If you change to a train on which a cheaper fare is available, the difference will not be refunded.\"}, {\"title\": \"DISCOUNTS\", \"description\": \"Child and railcard discounts apply.\"}, {\"title\": \"CODE\", \"description\": \"DNY\"}, {\"title\": \"ACCESSIBILITY\", \"description\": \"View information about wheelchair spaces and accessibility on board your train here www.nationalrail.co.uk/on-the-train/accessible-train-travel-and-facilities. Find out how to book travel assistance here www.nationalrail.co.uk/help-and-assistance/passenger-assist.\"}], \"validityPeriods\": {\"outward\": \"P1D\"}, \"conditionsSummary\": \"Flexibility to travel on LNER services within 70 minutes of the booked departure time. No refunds.\", \"secondaryFare\": false, \"farePricingCategory\": \"default\"}, \"10fdd036-2edf-4728-b8b1-46a33a733ce0\": {\"id\": \"10fdd036-2edf-4728-b8b1-46a33a733ce0\", \"name\": \"Anytime Single (1st Class)\", \"code\": \"urn:trainline:atoc:fare:FOS\", \"conditions\": [{\"title\": \"DESCRIPTION\", \"description\": \"Flexible ticket with no time restrictions on when you can travel.\"}, {\"title\": \"VALIDITY\", \"description\": \"Your journey must be on the date, or the day after the date, specified on the ticket.\"}, {\"title\": \"BOOKING\", \"description\": \"Can be booked in advance or purchased on the day of travel.\"}, {\"title\": \"REFUNDS\", \"description\": \"Refundable until 23:59 the day before the ticket becomes valid for travel. Non-refundable if purchased on the day of travel.\"}, {\"title\": \"AMENDING YOUR BOOKING\", \"description\": \"If you wish to travel on a date outside of the ticket validity period or change the Class of ticket, you will need to buy a new ticket and apply for a refund on your current ticket.\"}, {\"title\": \"DISCOUNTS\", \"description\": \"Yes - normal railcard and child discounts available.\"}, {\"title\": \"RAILCARDS\", \"description\": \"Only Senior, Disabled Persons and HM Forces Railcards secure discounts in First Class, and, subject to time restriction, the Two Together Railcard.\"}, {\"title\": \"BREAK OF JOURNEY\", \"description\": \"You may start, break and resume, or end your journey at any intermediate station along the route of travel.\"}, {\"title\": \"ADDITIONAL RESTRICTIONS\", \"description\": \"Mobile Tickets and etickets aren't valid for travel on London Underground. See our FAQs for more info.\"}, {\"title\": \"CODE\", \"description\": \"FOS\"}, {\"title\": \"ACCESSIBILITY\", \"description\": \"View information about wheelchair spaces and accessibility on board your train here www.nationalrail.co.uk/on-the-train/accessible-train-travel-and-facilities. Find out how to book travel assistance here www.nationalrail.co.uk/help-and-assistance/passenger-assist.\"}], \"validityPeriods\": {\"outward\": \"P2D\"}, \"conditionsSummary\": \"Travel any time of day.\", \"secondaryFare\": false, \"farePricingCategory\": \"default\"}, \"a7908f00-aeb5-4882-85c6-1bd8112f545f\": {\"id\": \"a7908f00-aeb5-4882-85c6-1bd8112f545f\", \"name\": \"LumoFixed (Standard Class)\", \"code\": \"urn:trainline:atoc:fare:L8O\", \"conditions\": [{\"title\": \"TICKET TYPE\", \"description\": \"ADVANCE\"}, {\"title\": \"DESCRIPTION\", \"description\": \"Non-refundable ticket, only valid for the date, time and trains specified.\"}, {\"title\": \"VALIDITY\", \"description\": \"You must travel on the date, time and trains specified. You may not start, break and resume, or end your journey at any intermediate station except to change to/from connecting trains as shown on the ticket(s) or other valid travel itinerary.\"}, {\"title\": \"BOOKING\", \"description\": \"Can be booked up until the day before travel, subject to availability.\"}, {\"title\": \"LUGGAGE\", \"description\": \"Permitted luggage onboard is 1 suitcase of max dimensions 63cm x 41cm x 27cm and a small bag which can fit under the seat or on an overhead rack or lap.\"}, {\"title\": \"REFUNDS\", \"description\": \"No refunds available.\"}, {\"title\": \"AMENDING YOUR BOOKING\", \"description\": \"Yes - date/time of tickets can be changed up until time of departure but the origin and destination have to remain the same, subject to the payment up to GBP 10.00 fee per ticket per person and any difference in fares. If you change to a train on which a cheaper fare is available, the difference will not be refunded. You can change your booking online through the My Account section.\"}, {\"title\": \"DISCOUNTS\", \"description\": \"Child discounts, 16-25 Railcard, Family and Friends Railcard (standard class only), Senior Railcard, Two Together Railcard, HM Forces and Disabled Persons Railcards discounts apply.\"}, {\"title\": \"CODE\", \"description\": \"L8O\"}, {\"title\": \"ACCESSIBILITY\", \"description\": \"View information about wheelchair spaces and accessibility on board your train here www.nationalrail.co.uk/on-the-train/accessible-train-travel-and-facilities. Find out how to book travel assistance here www.nationalrail.co.uk/help-and-assistance/passenger-assist.\"}], \"validityPeriods\": {\"outward\": \"P1D\"}, \"conditionsSummary\": \"Specified train only. No refunds.\", \"secondaryFare\": false, \"farePricingCategory\": \"default\"}, \"7fe6146d-4368-484e-8ee6-169e217f468c\": {\"id\": \"7fe6146d-4368-484e-8ee6-169e217f468c\", \"name\": \"LumoFixed (Standard Class)\", \"code\": \"