ee-free until one day before departure through our Customer Support.\"}, {\"title\": \"AMENDING YOUR BOOKING\", \"description\": \"Yes - date/time of tickets can be changed up to the day before you are due to travel but the origin and destination have to remain the same. No admin fee will be applied. If you change to a train on which a cheaper fare is available, the difference will not be refunded. You can change your booking online through the My Account section.\"}, {\"title\": \"DISCOUNTS\", \"description\": \"Child and railcard discounts apply.\"}, {\"title\": \"CODE\", \"description\": \"L3D\"}, {\"title\": \"ACCESSIBILITY\", \"description\": \"View information about wheelchair spaces and accessibility on board your train here www.nationalrail.co.uk/on-the-train/accessible-train-travel-and-facilities. Find out how to book travel assistance here www.nationalrail.co.uk/help-and-assistance/passenger-assist.\"}], \"validityPeriods\": {\"outward\": \"P1D\"}, \"conditionsSummary\": \"Specified train only. Refundable\", \"secondaryFare\": false, \"farePricingCategory\": \"default\"}, \"0cd2b280-89f2-4b2a-b476-a261abf9b7b1\": {\"id\": \"0cd2b280-89f2-4b2a-b476-a261abf9b7b1\", \"name\": \"LumoFixed (Standard Class)\", \"code\": \"urn:trainline:atoc:fare:L7A\", \"conditions\": [{\"title\": \"TICKET TYPE\", \"description\": \"ADVANCE\"}, {\"title\": \"DESCRIPTION\", \"description\": \"Non-refundable ticket, only valid for the date, time and trains specified.\"}, {\"title\": \"VALIDITY\", \"description\": \"You must travel on the date, time and trains specified. You may not start, break and resume, or end your journey at any intermediate station except to change to/from connecting trains as shown on the ticket(s) or other valid travel itinerary.\"}, {\"title\": \"BOOKING\", \"description\": \"Must be booked in advance of travel, subject to availability.\"}, {\"title\": \"LUGGAGE\", \"description\": \"Permitted luggage onboard is 1 suitcase of max dimensions 63cm x 41cm x 27cm and a small bag which can fit under the seat or on an overhead rack or lap.\"}, {\"title\": \"REFUNDS\", \"description\": \"No refunds available.\"}, {\"title\": \"AMENDING YOUR BOOKING\", \"description\": \"Yes - date/time of tickets can be changed up until time of departure but the origin and destination have to remain the same, subject to the payment up to GBP 10.00 fee per ticket per person and any difference in fares. If you change to a train on which a cheaper fare is available, the difference will not be refunded. You can change your booking online through the My Account section.\"}, {\"title\": \"DISCOUNTS\", \"description\": \"Child discounts and 16-25, 26-30, Family & Friends, Senior, HM Forces, Disabled Persons, Two Together Railcards discounts apply.\"}, {\"title\": \"CODE\", \"description\": \"L7A\"}, {\"title\": \"ACCESSIBILITY\", \"description\": \"View information about wheelchair spaces and accessibility on board your train here www.nationalrail.co.uk/on-the-train/accessible-train-travel-and-facilities. Find out how to book travel assistance here www.nationalrail.co.uk/help-and-assistance/passenger-assist.\"}], \"validityPeriods\": {\"outward\": \"P1D\"}, \"conditionsSummary\": \"Specified train only. No refunds.\", \"secondaryFare\": false, \"farePricingCategory\": \"default\"}, \"fe3391b6-db35-487a-ab6a-1e78e41caf78\": {\"id\": \"fe3391b6-db35-487a-ab6a-1e78e41caf78\", \"name\": \"LumoFlex (Standard Class)\", \"code\": \"urn:trainline:atoc:fare:L3C\", \"conditions\": [{\"title\": \"TICKET TYPE\", \"description\": \"ADVANCE\"}, {\"title\": \"DESCRIPTION\", \"description\": \"Refundable ticket, only valid for the date, time and trains specified.\"}, {\"title\": \"VALIDITY\", \"description\": \"You must travel on the date, time and trains specified. You may not start, break and resume, or end your journey at any intermediate station except to change to/from connecting trains as shown on the ticket(s) or other valid travel itinerary.\"}, {\"title\