f-peak times vary by route - our journey planner only shows off-peak tickets on trains for which they are valid.\"}, {\"title\": \"BOOKING\", \"description\": \"Can be booked in advance or purchased on the day of travel.\"}, {\"title\": \"REFUNDS\", \"description\": \"Refundable until 23:59 the day before the ticket becomes valid for travel. Non-refundable if purchased on the day of travel.\"}, {\"title\": \"AMENDING YOUR BOOKING\", \"description\": \"You can change the time of your journey without changing your tickets. If you wish to change your date of travel or Class of ticket, you will need to buy a new ticket and apply for a refund on your current ticket.\"}, {\"title\": \"DISCOUNTS\", \"description\": \"Yes - normal railcard and child discounts available.\"}, {\"title\": \"BREAK OF JOURNEY\", \"description\": \"Break of journey is generally permitted unless prohibited for the journey that you are making. If you intend to break your journey, please contact us to check if it is permitted. You can always break your journey where necessary to change train.\"}, {\"title\": \"ADDITIONAL RESTRICTIONS\", \"description\": \"Mobile Tickets and etickets aren't valid for travel on London Underground. See our FAQs for more info.\"}, {\"title\": \"CODE\", \"description\": \"SVS\"}, {\"title\": \"ACCESSIBILITY\", \"description\": \"View information about wheelchair spaces and accessibility on board your train here www.nationalrail.co.uk/on-the-train/accessible-train-travel-and-facilities. Find out how to book travel assistance here www.nationalrail.co.uk/help-and-assistance/passenger-assist.\"}], \"validityPeriods\": {\"outward\": \"P1D\"}, \"conditionsSummary\": \"Any off-peak train.\", \"secondaryFare\": false, \"farePricingCategory\": \"default\"}, \"d43ace55-5685-4b38-88aa-9d211f4ad230\": {\"id\": \"d43ace55-5685-4b38-88aa-9d211f4ad230\", \"name\": \"Advance Single Standard Premium\", \"code\": \"urn:trainline:atoc:fare:5PL\", \"conditions\": [{\"title\": \"TICKET TYPE\